Got it. The biggest win is: **stop doing `DaySlot × CrewSeat × BlockDecision` joins**. Those explode when horizon grows.

Instead, generate “worked dayIds” **per seat** by *flattening the seat span*, so the stream only produces tuples for days that seat actually works.

