## 3) dailyHeadCapacityByOp (optimized)

This one is huge in your current code. Flatten and count by (day, op).

Also: **don’t include pinnedFixed seats here** unless you also want fixed work to consume head-cap.
Most real models *should* include fixed, but for speed you can precompute a fixedHead map and add it.

### A) Dynamic-only + add fixed count map (fastest)

First build `FIXED_HEADS_BY_OP_DAY` once in `solveFromYaml()` (similar to FIXED_HOURS_BY_EMP_DAY), then constraint becomes cheap.

**Add global map:**

```java
static Map<Integer, Map<String, Integer>> FIXED_HEADS_BY_DAY_OP = new HashMap<>();
```

**Build it once (after parsing fixedRows, you already know opId/dayId):**

```java
FIXED_HEADS_BY_DAY_OP.clear();
for (FixedAssign fa : sch.fixedRows) {
    // If fixed assignment hoursByDay has >0, it counts as 1 head that day for that op.
    for (var e : fa.hoursByDay.entrySet()) {
        int dayId = e.getKey();
        int h = e.getValue();
        if (h <= 0) continue;
        // Optional: only count if working day at that factory
        String factory = fa.factory;
        if (!isWorkingDay(dayId, factory)) continue;

        FIXED_HEADS_BY_DAY_OP
            .computeIfAbsent(dayId, k -> new HashMap<>())
            .merge(fa.opId, 1, Integer::sum);
    }
}
```

**Constraint:**

```java
Constraint dailyHeadCapacityByOp(ConstraintFactory f) {
    var seatBlockDay = f.forEach(CrewSeat.class)
        .filter(s -> !isUnassigned(s.employee))
        .join(f.forEach(BlockDecision.class),
            Joiners.equal((CrewSeat s) -> s.blockId, (BlockDecision b) -> b.id))
        .filter((s, b) -> seatStart(s,b) != null && seatDays(s,b) != null && seatDays(s,b) > 0)
        // dynamic only
        .filter((s, b) -> !s.pinnedFixed)
        .flattenLast((s, b) -> workingDayIdsIterable(seatStart(s,b), seatDays(s,b), s.factory));

    return seatBlockDay
        .groupBy(
            (s, b, dayId) -> dayId,
            (s, b, dayId) -> s.opId,
            ConstraintCollectors.sum((s, b, dayId) -> 1)
        )
        .filter((dayId, opId, dynHeads) -> {
            int fixed = FIXED_HEADS_BY_DAY_OP
                .getOrDefault(dayId, Collections.emptyMap())
                .getOrDefault(opId, 0);
            int total = dynHeads + fixed;
            return total > OP_CAPACITY.getOrDefault(opId, Integer.MAX_VALUE);
        })
        .penalize(HardMediumSoftScore.ONE_HARD, (dayId, opId, dynHeads) -> {
            int fixed = FIXED_HEADS_BY_DAY_OP
                .getOrDefault(dayId, Collections.emptyMap())
                .getOrDefault(opId, 0);
            int cap = OP_CAPACITY.getOrDefault(opId, Integer.MAX_VALUE);
            return (dynHeads + fixed) - cap;
        })
        .asConstraint("daily-head-capacity-by-op");
}
```

