## 4) Region constraints: don’t build EmpDay by joining all DaySlots

Use the same flatten trick to produce (emp, dayId, region) only where they actually work.

### Shared stream for region work-days (dynamic + fixed optional)

Here I show **dynamic-only**. If you want fixed included, do the same “precompute fixed region days” trick like for heads.

```java
static final class EmpRegionDay {
    final int empId;
    final String regionId;
    final int dayId;
    EmpRegionDay(int empId, String regionId, int dayId) {
        this.empId = empId; this.regionId = regionId; this.dayId = dayId;
    }
    int empId() { return empId; }
    String regionId() { return regionId; }
    int dayId() { return dayId; }
}
